<body>
    <div class="document">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title">REPORT ON THE STATE OF THE UNION</div>
            <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 10px;">Delivered by the President</div>
            <div style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 11pt;">Date: January 20, 2025</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Body Text -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="heading">Introduction</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                Ladies and gentlemen, good evening. Tonight I stand before you to report on the state of our Union — a Union that is stronger, safer, and more united than ever before.
            </div>
            <div class="body-text">
                The past year has been one of extraordinary achievement. We have protected our borders, created millions of new jobs, and restored common sense to our government.
            </div>
        </div>

