        <div class="section">
            <div class="heading">Economic Highlights</div>
            <div class="two-col">
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="body-text">
                        Unemployment has reached a historic low of 3.1%. 
                    </div>
                    <div class="body-text">
                        Inflation is under control at 2.4%.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="body-text">
                        Wages are rising faster than prices.
